────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
1. DEFINITIONS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

"Free Edition"
    Refers to this publicly distributed version of Atlas PDF Viewer,
    as released by PatronHubDevs Technologies under this license.

"Pro Edition"
    Refers to the commercial, separately licensed version of Atlas PDF
    Viewer, which includes the ATLAS encrypted document format, the
    Rust-powered cryptographic engine, annotation tools, and other
    premium features not present in the Free Edition.

"Pro Features"
    Any functionality, modules, binaries, cryptographic routines, or
    document format specifications that are exclusive to the Pro Edition,
    including but not limited to: atlas_format.py (full ATLAS container),
    crypto_engine.py, crypto_engine_legacy.py, atlas_decrypt_worker.py,
    and any associated Rust crates or compiled extensions.

"Derivative Work"
    Any software, tool, application, or system that incorporates,
    modifies, forks, wraps, or is substantially derived from the
    source code or binaries of the Free Edition.

"Author"
    Marco Polo, operating under PatronHubDevs Technologies, Philippines.

