6. PRIVACY GUARANTEE (NON-BINDING DISCLOSURE)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The Author warrants, to the best of their ability and by design, that
Atlas PDF Viewer — Free Edition:

  — Collects no user data, telemetry, or analytics.
  — Makes no outbound network connections during normal operation.
  — Does not transmit, upload, or cache user documents to any remote
    server or cloud storage system.
  — Processes all documents locally and in-memory only.

This disclosure is provided for transparency and does not constitute a
legally binding data processing agreement. Enterprise deployments
requiring formal DPA or GDPR compliance documentation should contact
the Author directly.

